    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for retrieving product information about a Qlik Sense site, including system details, installed components, external URLs, and third-party software information. The About Service API provides read-only endpoints that return JSON-formatted information about the Qlik Sense deployment.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Qlik Support",
